<title>USA: First Union Real Estate sets over-allotment.</title>
<headline>First Union Real Estate sets over-allotment.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Real Estate Investments said on Friday that it had exercised its over-allotment option of 825,000 shares as part of a recently completed common shares offering.</p>
<p>First Union said it now has 35.6 million common shares outstanding on a fully converted basis.</p>
<p>The company, a real estate investment trust, completed the offering of 5.5 million common shares at $12.50 per share on May 29.</p>
</text>
